{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19046","headline":"奉和司空裴相公中书即事通简旧僚之作 · 刘禹锡","name":"奉和司空裴相公中书即事通简旧僚之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谭笑在岩廊，人人尽所长。\n仪形见山立，文字动星光。\n日运丹青笔，时看赤白囊。\n伫闻戎马息，入贺领鸳行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}